// Otto Godblessed - imported from the rev 474 cache (npc 2725) by tools/models/importnpc474.py, with
// his three chathead models (474 26661, 11807, 26830) copied the same way. A plain human: 474's own
// stance and walks are 808 and 819-822, which are 377's human_ready and human_walk_*.
// He lives in his house at Otto's Grotto (wiki: 2502,3489, on the south-west side of the lake above
// Baxtorian Falls), spawned from maps/m39_54.jm2 at 2503,3489: the one free tile off the path from
// the door to the bed. The hut is four tiles square and bed, table and chair fill most of it, so he
// stands still - a step either way and he would be in the doorway or boxed in behind the furniture.

